00:00:28.995 --> 00:00:30.130
I mean, Mitt Romney,

00:00:30.130 --> 00:00:31.598
the man goes to the State of the Union

00:00:31.598 --> 00:00:32.332
of the United States

00:00:32.332 --> 00:00:34.134
