00:00:43.443 --> 00:00:44.244
Oh, snap.

00:00:44.244 --> 00:00:45.979
Let's put this into context, shall we?

00:00:45.979 --> 00:00:47.080
In 1955,

00:00:47.080 --> 00:00:48.415
Rosa Parks was arrested in Montgomery,

00:00:48.415 --> 00:00:48.882
Alabama,

00:00:48.882 --> 00:00:49.682
