00:00:52.452 --> 00:00:54.721
Her act of extraordinary courage

00:00:54.721 --> 00:00:55.355
and defiance

00:00:55.355 --> 00:00:57.424
led to the Montgomery bus boycott

00:00:57.424 --> 00:00:59.125
and is known as

00:00:59.125 --> 00:01:00.860
one of the earliest

00:01:00.860 --> 00:01:01.928
starting points of the civil

00:01:01.928 --> 00:01:02.662
rights movement.

00:01:02.662 --> 00:01:04.230
Nearly a year later,

00:01:04.230 --> 00:01:04.864
